(longtable under `\subsection*{Agents}`, main.tex L2027) has five
forced-equal-width columns (`\real{0.2000}`): #, Vendor, Model,
Country, Surface. Drop the Country column and let column widths size
naturally.

Finding 3 pre-verified during planning: the author's recall is
correct. `experiments/models.yaml` records the Exp 2 model as
